Dear MSstats Team

We've already processed quite some datasets exported from SpectroNaut with MSstats (4.2.0 with R 4.1.2), but this recent file (see here <https://filesender.switch.ch/filesender2/?s=download&token=0f375a03-dd8d-45de-9847-02287bf7a55d>) always crashed during subplot summarization due to insufficient memory (despite having 180GB RAM (!) available). Can you explain what's going on here?

Thank you very much already for looking into this issue!

Best,
Christian

